<title>CROATIA: TENNIS-CROATIAN TOURNAMENT FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CROATIAN TOURNAMENT FIRST ROUND RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>UMAG, Croatia 1997-07-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results in the first round</p>
<p>of the Croatian international men's tournament on Monday:</p>
<p>Marzio Martelli (Italy) beat Zeljko Krajan (Croatia) 6-1 7-5</p>
<p>Ivan Ljubicic (Croatia) beat Andrei Ribalko (Ukraine) 6-4 6-4</p>
<p>5-Dominik Hrbaty (Slovakia) beat Sergi Duran (Spain) 6-3 7-6</p>
<p>Andrei Merinov (Russia) beat Razvan Sabau (Romania) 6-4 5-7 6-2</p>
<p>Jacobo Diaz (Spain) beat Emanuel Rasberger (Croatia) 6-3 4-6</p>
<p>6-4</p>
</text>
